{"cluster_id": "C-2291", "topic": "Store::readManifestShared has the same mandatory HEAD, fail-closed FILE_DOESNT_EXIST", "target": "architecture/manifests-and-refs", "member_ids": ["B008-006"], "canonical_claim": "`Store::readManifestShared` has the same mandatory `HEAD`, fail-closed `FILE_DOESNT_EXIST` and `CORRUPTED_DATA` behavior, and manifest-cache insertion semantics as `readManifest`, but returns the cached `std::shared_ptr<const PartManifest>` without a per-call copy.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-08-cas-part-folder-cache-phase1.md#task-3"]}
