{"cluster_id": "C-2305", "topic": "A transaction containing namespace_birth and its optional first", "target": "architecture/manifests-and-refs", "member_ids": ["B010-061"], "canonical_claim": "A transaction containing `namespace_birth` and its optional first owner transition runs alone; `clear_precommits_before` and `remove_namespace` also run alone, and a batch never crosses its encoded-size or operation-count limit.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-10-cas-ref-snapshot-log-design.md#flat-combined-append"]}
